# Matches compose.yaml (docker compose up -d postgres azurite)
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=ledger;Username=ledger;Password=ledger
ConnectionStrings__BlobStorage=UseDevelopmentStorage=true
Jwt__SigningKey=<change-me>
Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=<client-url>

# OpenTelemetry (leave endpoint empty to disable export)
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=ledger-api
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=grpc

# Google OAuth (Web client). Redirect URI must also be registered in Google Cloud console.
Google__ClientId=
Google__ClientSecret=
Google__RedirectUri=http://localhost:5106/api/auth/google/callback
Client__BaseUrl=http://localhost:5173
